            range 0 1
            default 0 if FREERTOS_UNICORE
            default 1
            help
                On a single-core FreeRTOS build every task runs on core 0; the
                other core may not be running FreeRTOS at all.

        config ML_TASK_WG_MGR_CORE
            int "Core the WireGuard manager task is pinned to"
            range 0 1
            default 0 if FREERTOS_UNICORE
            default 1
            help
                On a single-core FreeRTOS build every task runs on core 0; the
                other core may not be running FreeRTOS at all.

    endmenu

endmenu
